OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FSainsbury's is to increase supplies of
OL,7,FBritish tomatoes, cucumbers and
OL,8,Fpeppers amid fears of drought
OL,9,Faffecting crops imported from abroad.
OL,11,FThe UK's second biggest supermarket
OL,12,Fhas signed new 10-year partnerships
OL,13,Fwith UK producers Evesham Vale Growers
OL,14,Fand Thanet Earth to ensure it can keep
OL,15,Fa steady supply of tomatoes, peppers
OL,16,Fand cucumbers on its shelves.
OL,18,FThe produce has been badly affected by
OL,19,Fweather-based shocks in the past.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
