OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FIn early 2023, supermarkets imposed
OL,7,Flimits of three on packs of tomatoes,
OL,8,Fas well as cucumbers, peppers,
OL,9,Flettuce, salad bags and some
OL,10,Fvegetables after a combination of bad
OL,11,Fweather and related transport problems
OL,12,Fin north Africa and Europe led to
OL,13,Fwidespread shortages on UK shelves.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
