CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FSainsbury's said British-grown
OL,7,Ftomatoes, peppers and cucumbers were
OL,8,Falready an important part of its salad
OL,9,Foffer to customers, but extreme
OL,10,Fweather across warmer growing regions
OL,11,Fhad underlined the need for
OL,12,Fsupermarkets to think differently
OL,13,Fabout how they build more resilient
OL,14,Fsupply chains.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FThe grocer said it hoped its long-term
OL,7,Fagreement with Thanet Earth would
OL,8,Fextend availability of British
OL,9,Fcucumbers beyond the summer season
OL,10,Finto the winter months for the first
OL,11,Ftime, after traditionally relying more
OL,12,Fheavily on imports.
OL,14,FThe new British winter crop will be
OL,15,Fgrown at Thanet Earth in Kent, the
OL,16,FUK's largest single site glasshouse
OL,17,Fcomplex, where supplementary lighting,
OL,18,Fheat, and CO2 are managed to create
OL,19,Fthe conditions cucumber plants need to
OL,20,Fkeep growing through the darkest
OL,21,Fmonths of the year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FBenefits of the agreements would be
OL,7,Fseen on shelves as early as this
OL,8,Fsummer with the launch of the new
OL,9,FTaste the Difference British Salad
OL,10,FSelection 800g box.
OL,12,FHannah O'Reilly, category director of
OL,13,Fproduce at Sainsbury's, said: "With
OL,14,Four changing weather, it's more
OL,15,Fimportant than ever to find new,
OL,16,Finnovative solutions to make sure our
OL,17,Fcustomers can continue to enjoy the
OL,18,Fquality produce they want all year-
OL,19,Fround.
OL,26,@uD@_OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,F"Investing in more British production
OL,7,Fand supporting our suppliers to
OL,8,Finnovate is helping us build a
OL,9,Fstronger, more resilient supply chain
OL,10,Fin a category that has been impacted
OL,11,Fby weather-based shocks in recent
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,F"By giving our brilliant British
OL,15,Fgrowers the certainty to invest and
OL,16,Finnovate through long-term contracts
OL,17,Fsuch as these with Thanet Earth and
OL,18,FEvesham Vale Growers will help us to
OL,19,Fcontinue to support British farming
OL,20,Ffor years to come."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU|D@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785050285
OL,3,CSainsbury's to increase British salad
OL,4,Cproduce amid drought fears abroad
OL,6,FRob James, technical director at
OL,7,FThanet Earth, said: "Working with
OL,8,FSainsbury's in this way means we can
OL,9,Fplan ahead with more certainty and
OL,10,Fkeep pushing what's possible for
OL,11,FBritish growing.
OL,13,F"A good example is our investment in
OL,14,Fthe technology needed to grow
OL,15,Fcucumbers through the winter, creating
OL,16,Fthe right conditions for the crop and
OL,17,Fhelping bring more British-grown
OL,18,Fproduce to customers at a time of year
OL,19,Fwhen that has not previously been
OL,20,Fpossible."
OL,26,@oD@UOUuD@AOU|D@JO]
